	"overridesComment": "cookie <0.7 accepts out-of-bounds characters in a cookie name, path or domain (GHSA-pxg6-pf52-xh8x). @sveltejs/kit still pins ^0.6 as of 2.70.1, its latest, so resolving it forward here is the only fix. 0.7 keeps the same parse/serialize API and only tightens validation.",
